# Project context

- Full map: `docs/DOMAINS.md`
- This repo: **Burn & Build** — three standalone pieces on **burnandbuilddiet.com**

Push to `main` deploys the static site via GitHub Pages.

## Three pieces

| Piece | Path | Role |
|-------|------|------|
| **Landing** | `/` (`index.html`, `hardkor.css`) | Marketing — standalone |
| **Burn Engine** | `js/burnEngine.js`, `data/foods.json` | Serving math — standalone |
| **PDF** | `server/pdf/`, `js/*Printout.js` | Burn & Build Diet program report — standalone |

Shell between them (questionnaire, checkout, API) was removed for a clean rebuild. **Reconnect** landing → questionnaire → checkout when ready.

**Product name:** Burn & Build Diet (never “meal planner” in user-facing copy).

## File naming (role suffix)

Every `js/` file name ends with its job:

| Suffix | Meaning | Examples |
|--------|---------|----------|
| **Engine** | Math / computation | `burnEngine.js`, `profileDataEngine.js` |
| **Data** | Structured objects, constants, copy strings | `programPackageData.js`, `programReportCopyData.js` |
| **Helpers** | Small utility functions | `programClientDataHelpers.js`, `dietPdfNamingHelpers.js` |
| **Printout** | One PDF section payload | `servingsPrintout.js`, `answersConfirmationPrintout.js` |
| **Fixtures** | Test / preview sample inputs | `programReportPreviewFixtures.js` |

## Key files

| File | What it is |
|------|------------|
| `js/burnEngine.js` | Serving math |
| `js/profileDataEngine.js` | Customer answers → profile |
| `js/programPackageData.js` | Full program object (`pkg.intake` + plan) |
| `js/programReportPrintout.js` | Full PDF payload |
| `js/answersConfirmationPrintout.js` | PDF page 12 — answer list |
| `js/leanBodyAnalysisPrintout.js` | PDF lean body analysis page |
| `js/programClientDataHelpers.js` | Client name + date on PDF |

There is **no** separate questionnaire PDF — answers appear on page 12 of the one program report.

## Verify (engine + PDF)

```
npm run verify:printout-calcs
npm run verify:pdf
```

## Program report PDF

Renderer: `server/pdf/` (PDFKit). Preview: `npm run render:program-report-preview`. See `.cursor/rules/program-report-preview-pdf.mdc`.

## Locked paths (when shell is rebuilt)

- Questionnaire: `/questionnaire/`
- Checkout: `/createyourfoodplan/`
